                "text": "<p>After more than 12 years working as a wellness coach, personal trainer, and nutrition advisor, Joshua Haag saw a gap in the supplement space too much noise, too little clarity. Vybrant was born from his mission to cut through that confusion and give people real tools for real results.Grounded in science and built around structured support, Vybrant reflects Joshua’s belief that true wellness is holistic combining the right nutrients with the right habits, delivered in a way that fits real life. This isn’t just a brand. It’s the system he wished every client had from day one.</p>",
